    {
      "id": "reciprocal-power-proof-chains",
      "view": {
        "mode": "multiple",
        "stem": "依据负整数指数幂的定义，判断以下推导及其适用条件。涉及 $n$ 时，$n\\in\\mathbb Z$ 且 $n<0$；涉及字母分式时，还须判断原式是否有意义。哪些选项完整正确？",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "$\\left(\\frac23\\right)^{-1}=\\frac{1}{\\frac23}=\\frac32$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "$\\left(\\frac35\\right)^{-2}=\\frac{1}{\\left(\\frac35\\right)^2}=\\frac{1}{\\frac9{25}}=\\frac{25}{9}=\\left(\\frac53\\right)^2$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "若 $p\\ne0,\\ q\\ne0$，则 $\\left(\\frac pq\\right)^{-1}=\\frac{1}{\\frac pq}=\\frac qp$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
            "text": "若 $p\\ne0,\\ q\\ne0$，令 $m=-n$，则 $m$ 为正整数，且 $\\left(\\frac pq\\right)^n=\\frac{1}{\\left(\\frac pq\\right)^m}=\\frac{q^m}{p^m}=\\left(\\frac qp\\right)^m=\\left(\\frac qp\\right)^{-n}$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "E",
            "text": "只要 $q\\ne0$，即使 $p=0$，仍有 $\\left(\\frac pq\\right)^{-1}=\\frac{1}{\\frac pq}=\\frac qp$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "F",
            "text": "若 $p\\ne0,\\ q\\ne0$，则 $\\left(\\frac pq\\right)^n=\\frac{1}{\\left(\\frac pq\\right)^{-n}}=\\left(\\frac qp\\right)^n$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
